  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sholep Energy Solar Mini-Grid Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the support of USADF, Sholep will install a solar mini-grid to distribute and sell electricity to rural Nigerians. The mini-grid will provide electricity to households at night, while also maximizing electricity availability for productive use during the day, including for millers, welders, mechanics and carpenters.</narrative>
  </description>
